                      "blocks": {
                        "contentData": [],
                        "settingsData": [],
                        "expose": [],
                        "layout": {}
                      },
                      "markup": "Ng\u01B0\u1EDDi kh\u00E1c b\u1EA3o b\u1EA1n \u003Cstrong\u003Equ\u00E9t khu\u00F4n m\u1EB7t\u003C/strong\u003E ho\u1EB7c g\u1EEDi \u1EA3nh gi\u1EA5y t\u1EDD.\u003Csmall\u003E\u2713 B\u1EA1n t\u1EF1 m\u1EDF \u1EE9ng d\u1EE5ng c\u1EE7a m\u00ECnh cho vi\u1EC7c do ch\u00EDnh b\u1EA1n b\u1EAFt \u0111\u1EA7u th\u00EC b\u00ECnh th\u01B0\u1EDDng.\u003C/small\u003E"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "alias": "isExtra",
                    "culture": null,
                    "editorAlias": null,
                    "segment": null,
                    "value": "0"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "contentTypeKey": "c95be742-cf71-4213-8a00-50ffe1444c51",
                "key": "6f10f1ca-e7a8-54f7-bf01-d0df8ed1a0dd",
                "values": [
                  {
                    "alias": "title",
                    "culture": null,
                    "editorAlias": null,
                    "segment": null,
                    "value": "B\u1EAFt b\u1EA1n quy\u1EBFt \u0111\u1ECBnh ngay, gi\u1EEF b\u00ED m\u1EADt, ho\u1EB7c kh\u00F4ng cho h\u1ECFi ng\u01B0\u1EDDi th\u00E2n. C\u1EA3n b\u1EA1n t\u1EF1 g"
                  },
                  {
                    "alias": "text",
                    "culture": null,
                    "editorAlias": null,
                    "segment": null,
                    "value": {
                      "blocks": {
                        "contentData": [],
                        "settingsData": [],
                        "expose": [],
                        "layout": {}
                      },
                      "markup": "B\u1EAFt b\u1EA1n \u003Cstrong\u003Equy\u1EBFt \u0111\u1ECBnh ngay\u003C/strong\u003E, gi\u1EEF b\u00ED m\u1EADt, ho\u1EB7c kh\u00F4ng cho h\u1ECFi ng\u01B0\u1EDDi th\u00E2n. C\u1EA3n b\u1EA1n t\u1EF1 g\u1ECDi l\u1EA1i s\u1ED1 ch\u00EDnh th\u1EE9c ho\u1EB7c t\u1EF1 m\u1EDF website ch\u00EDnh th\u1EE9c."
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "alias": "isExtra",
                    "culture": null,
                    "editorAlias": null,
                    "segment": null,
                    "value": "0"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "contentTypeKey": "c95be742-cf71-4213-8a00-50ffe1444c51",
                "key": "abaee1a4-5c3a-5e06-b02a-3318d7b9db0e",
                "values": [
                  {
                    "alias": "title",
                    "culture": null,
                    "editorAlias": null,
                    "segment": null,
                    "value": "\u0110\u1EC1 ngh\u1ECB b\u1EA1n cho m\u01B0\u1EE3n, cho thu\u00EA, b\u00E1n ho\u1EB7c m\u1EDF h\u1ED9 t\u00E0i kho\u1EA3n ng\u00E2n h\u00E0ng, v\u00ED \u0111i\u1EC7n t\u1EED, "
                  },
                  {
                    "alias": "text",
                    "culture": null,
                    "editorAlias": null,
                    "segment": null,
                    "value": {
                      "blocks": {
                        "contentData": [],
                        "settingsData": [],
                        "expose": [],
                        "layout": {}
                      },
                      "markup": "\u0110\u1EC1 ngh\u1ECB b\u1EA1n \u003Cstrong\u003Echo m\u01B0\u1EE3n, cho thu\u00EA, b\u00E1n ho\u1EB7c m\u1EDF h\u1ED9\u003C/strong\u003E t\u00E0i kho\u1EA3n ng\u00E2n h\u00E0ng, v\u00ED \u0111i\u1EC7n t\u1EED, SIM, d\u00F9 \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c tr\u1EA3 ti\u1EC1n c\u00F4ng. T\u1EEB ch\u1ED1i ngay."
                    }
                  },
